# PHASE 2: COMPLETE USD REMOVAL AND BDT STANDARDIZATION

The entire business operates in Bangladesh.

BDT (Bangladeshi Taka) must become the only active application currency.

Currency code: BDT

Currency symbol: ৳

Currency display example: ৳1,250.00

Currency locale: en-BD or an appropriate Bangladeshi locale.

## 2.1 Frontend Currency Migration

Update every relevant frontend component:

- Homepage product prices.
- Product listing cards.
- Product detail pages.
